WEBVTT

01:35.860 --> 01:40.770
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.620 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 21]

01:44.840 --> 01:46.500
Your Majesty, here, have one.

01:48.680 --> 01:49.940
Come on, Your Majesty,

01:50.310 --> 01:51.070
try this.

01:51.840 --> 01:52.900
Have some wine too.

01:53.479 --> 01:54.479
Have another one.

01:59.000 --> 01:59.840
I missed it again.

01:59.840 --> 02:00.570
Your Majesty,

02:00.570 --> 02:02.070
I've sent
the Prince of Zhennan and his party

02:02.070 --> 02:03.150
to the Rongyang Palace.

02:03.150 --> 02:03.800
So?

02:03.940 --> 02:04.870
Did they like it?

02:06.310 --> 02:06.680
Here.

02:12.430 --> 02:13.230
Bai Shouzhuo,

02:14.240 --> 02:15.750
I like your honesty.

02:16.190 --> 02:17.430
You don't butter me up

02:17.750 --> 02:18.410
or lie to me.

02:20.710 --> 02:22.470
The prince didn't show much reaction.

02:22.470 --> 02:23.870
But the Princess of Zhennan

02:23.870 --> 02:25.280
didn't seem very pleased.

02:25.280 --> 02:27.150
The Princess of Zhennan…

02:28.240 --> 02:28.870
Also,

02:29.030 --> 02:30.360
the wife
of Vice Revenue Minister Huang

02:30.360 --> 02:33.290
is coming to the palace tomorrow
to visit her sister.

02:33.710 --> 02:34.510
Bai Shouzhuo,

02:36.520 --> 02:37.630
earlier today,

02:37.800 --> 02:39.710
I saw the dress
that princess from Susha was wearing—

02:39.710 --> 02:40.870
absolutely stunning.

02:40.870 --> 02:41.930
Get one just like it

02:42.280 --> 02:43.680
and send it to Mrs. Huang.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.400
Yes.

02:47.360 --> 02:47.960
Also…

02:48.870 --> 02:50.310
Go tell the Prince of Zhennan

02:50.310 --> 02:51.430
that since he's back,

02:51.430 --> 02:52.550
I'll hold a banquet

02:52.710 --> 02:54.190
to welcome him.

02:54.910 --> 02:55.870
Let's…

02:56.590 --> 02:57.650
set it for tonight.

02:58.560 --> 02:59.290
Don't forget

02:59.470 --> 03:01.930
to tell him to bring
the Princess of Zhennan.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.280
Yes.

03:04.710 --> 03:05.360
Go now.

03:08.190 --> 03:09.590
Do you think what Ling Feng said

03:09.590 --> 03:10.190
is true?

03:10.520 --> 03:12.320
Is Feng Pingcheng really dying?

03:13.590 --> 03:14.790
A matter this serious

03:15.190 --> 03:16.280
wouldn't be fake.

03:17.030 --> 03:19.000
If the Emperor could die at any moment,

03:19.000 --> 03:20.530
then fortune is on our side.

03:23.560 --> 03:24.750
But Prime Minister,

03:25.030 --> 03:26.360
you don't seem pleased.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.560
What are you here for?

03:28.750 --> 03:30.880
Be careful. Feng Suige might catch on.

03:31.630 --> 03:32.710
Fu Yixiao has figured out

03:32.710 --> 03:33.570
who I really am.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.560
But Feng Suige still doesn't know.

03:35.560 --> 03:36.360
I haven't given Fu Yixiao

03:36.360 --> 03:37.630
any chance to approach him.

03:37.630 --> 03:38.150
Later,

03:38.680 --> 03:39.680
I'll find a way to keep Feng Suige

03:39.680 --> 03:40.560
in the palace.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.710
You think Fu Yixiao will just
do as you say?

03:43.710 --> 03:45.360
She cares a lot about Feng Suige,

03:45.360 --> 03:46.190
so she won't risk

03:46.190 --> 03:47.400
calling my bluff.

03:47.470 --> 03:48.190
I've warned her—

03:48.190 --> 03:49.920
if Feng Suige learns the truth,

03:50.000 --> 03:51.260
I'll kill the Emperor.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.120
Let me remind you:

03:56.840 --> 03:57.900
without my orders,

03:58.150 --> 04:00.010
you must not kill Feng Pingcheng.

04:00.300 --> 04:02.440
The heir to the throne
hasn't been decided.

04:02.440 --> 04:04.100
If Feng Pingcheng dies now,

04:04.200 --> 04:05.460
Feng Suige will be next

04:05.470 --> 04:06.930
in the line of succession.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.930
You must not act on your own.

04:10.430 --> 04:11.470
We've already removed Hou Jing

04:11.470 --> 04:12.800
from the Ministry of War.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.870
You now control the central court
and all six ministries.

04:14.870 --> 04:15.710
If you kill Feng Pingcheng

04:15.710 --> 04:16.750
and make Feng Chengyang take the throne,

04:16.750 --> 04:17.810
who could stop you?

04:18.070 --> 04:19.130
Now is the best time

04:19.160 --> 04:20.079
to kill Feng Pingcheng!

04:20.079 --> 04:21.190
I'll say it again—

04:22.360 --> 04:23.380
without my order,

04:23.720 --> 04:25.560
you must not kill the Emperor.

04:33.630 --> 04:34.680
I was just joking.

04:36.159 --> 04:37.960
I wouldn't dare act recklessly.

04:38.430 --> 04:40.070
Regicide is a serious crime.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.510
Of course I'll listen to
your instructions.

04:42.510 --> 04:43.480
You can put on an act

04:43.480 --> 04:44.480
for others,

04:44.800 --> 04:47.270
but spare me that spoiled

04:48.000 --> 04:49.800
young marquis attitude.

04:51.720 --> 04:52.800
You can't hide

04:53.270 --> 04:54.930
your true intentions from me.

04:56.870 --> 04:58.720
I'm really making a fool of myself.

04:58.720 --> 05:00.310
I'm nothing compared to you—

05:00.310 --> 05:02.280
a wily old fox

05:02.390 --> 05:03.160
who manages

05:03.160 --> 05:05.040
to pass as a loyal, upright statesman

05:05.040 --> 05:07.040
and make the whole world believe it.

05:07.240 --> 05:08.240
That's something

05:08.270 --> 05:10.160
I need to learn from you.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.280
All right.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.290
I'm leaving.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.870
I just hope that once it's all over,

05:17.870 --> 05:20.400
you and I can sit down
and celebrate together.

05:20.430 --> 05:22.000
But do you think by then,

05:23.720 --> 05:24.950
we'll really be able to sit down

05:24.950 --> 05:25.950
and enjoy a drink?

05:32.430 --> 05:33.290
Let me warn you:

05:33.920 --> 05:35.120
the truth will eventually come out.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.720
I can keep Feng Suige in the dark for now,

05:36.720 --> 05:37.800
but not forever.

05:38.190 --> 05:39.990
If Fu Yixiao tells him the truth,

05:40.240 --> 05:41.830
everything will come to light.

05:41.830 --> 05:42.240
Prime Minister,

05:42.240 --> 05:43.970
think about the consequences.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.560
Murong Yao

06:02.800 --> 06:04.610
looks like a harmless noble heir,

06:04.610 --> 06:06.550
naive and easy to read,

06:07.270 --> 06:08.240
but in truth,

06:08.820 --> 06:09.880
he's anything but.

06:13.390 --> 06:15.590
[Wutong Mansion]

06:14.440 --> 06:17.280
Actually, he's calculating and meticulous.

06:17.950 --> 06:19.190
His eyes and ears are all over

06:19.190 --> 06:20.590
Feng Suige's residence.

06:24.050 --> 06:25.040
The four ladies

06:25.040 --> 06:26.300
who are always with him

06:26.630 --> 06:28.760
should all be his trusted operatives.

06:29.000 --> 06:29.560
Yes.

06:30.840 --> 06:32.430
Chunhan, Xiachen,

06:32.470 --> 06:33.880
Qiuxi, and Dongxiao—

06:34.040 --> 06:35.040
the four of them are

06:35.040 --> 06:37.370
Murong Yao's
most trusted subordinates.

06:37.950 --> 06:40.310
The two assassins
who came after me that day

06:40.310 --> 06:42.940
were Chunhan and Qiuxi.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.070
So,

06:45.510 --> 06:47.240
his frequent visits to pleasure houses

06:47.240 --> 06:48.510
and daily debauchery

06:48.830 --> 06:49.430
are all

06:50.000 --> 06:51.040
deliberate acts

06:51.040 --> 06:52.070
to fool everyone.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.120
Yes.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.440
He's always surrounded

06:55.510 --> 06:56.640
by beautiful girls.

06:57.430 --> 06:59.090
But that's just his disguise.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.560
He's very ambitious,

07:01.040 --> 07:01.870
and he's never

07:02.430 --> 07:03.960
let any woman distract him.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.270
Miss, your beauty is unmatched

07:08.270 --> 07:09.240
and captivating.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.750
May I ask your name?

07:11.560 --> 07:13.410
I feel like we've met before.

07:13.830 --> 07:15.000
It must be that night!

07:15.000 --> 07:15.920
You're the very girl

07:15.920 --> 07:16.920
I saw in my dreams.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.950
When he first saw me in Yujing,

07:20.430 --> 07:21.430
he was testing me

07:21.560 --> 07:22.390
to see if I recognized

07:22.390 --> 07:23.790
Meng Junran's identity.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.430
Who does he care about the most?

07:26.430 --> 07:27.190
Feng Suige.

07:28.430 --> 07:29.690
He's just pretending.

07:31.390 --> 07:32.240
And…

07:33.159 --> 07:34.620
and Elder Marquis Murong.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.620
Elder Marquis Murong?

07:37.310 --> 07:38.770
Murong Yao is a filial son.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.870
He obeys the Elder Marquis completely

07:40.870 --> 07:42.159
and hates to upset him.

07:46.120 --> 07:48.510
You advised me to leave Yujing before.

07:49.190 --> 07:51.190
But I don't want to give up so easily.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.950
If he can be so cruel,

07:53.800 --> 07:54.750
I'll fight him

07:55.680 --> 07:56.680
to the bitter end.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.890
You're no match for him.

07:59.040 --> 07:59.920
His methods are ruthless,

07:59.920 --> 08:01.320
and he has so many guards.

08:01.510 --> 08:02.120
I don't want you

08:02.120 --> 08:03.240
to get hurt again.

08:03.870 --> 08:04.650
Don't worry.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.590
I won't act impulsively.

08:07.070 --> 08:08.270
I'll observe patiently

08:08.270 --> 08:09.920
and wait for the right moment.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.040
Then I'll make him

08:12.600 --> 08:13.560
pay the price.

08:15.560 --> 08:16.720
Be very careful.

08:17.040 --> 08:18.120
If you need anything,

08:18.120 --> 08:19.630
come find me at Zhengnian Hall.

08:19.630 --> 08:21.040
If I'm not there, leave a note.

08:21.040 --> 08:21.800
I'll see it.

08:23.310 --> 08:23.950
Thank you,

08:24.920 --> 08:25.720
Miss Yixiao.

08:30.750 --> 08:31.680
I didn't know.

08:32.630 --> 08:33.960
He never told me

08:33.960 --> 08:35.020
about his illness.

08:36.000 --> 08:36.659
Chengyang,

08:37.240 --> 08:38.970
go to your father now.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.440
Go stay with him.

08:41.240 --> 08:41.960
Mother,

08:42.360 --> 08:43.200
what about you?

08:43.200 --> 08:44.080
You go first.

08:44.720 --> 08:46.320
I still have a few things to discuss

08:46.320 --> 08:47.650
with your grandfather.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.150
All right.

08:55.150 --> 08:55.840
Mother.

08:58.270 --> 08:58.870
Alright.

08:59.150 --> 08:59.910
Go now.

09:01.030 --> 09:01.510
Okay.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.910
He never told me about it.

09:07.550 --> 09:08.440
I didn't know.

09:08.510 --> 09:09.710
I knew nothing at all.

09:10.740 --> 09:12.960
I'm the Empress of Susha,

09:13.080 --> 09:14.320
his wife.

09:15.670 --> 09:17.670
Yet he kept hiding it from me.

09:18.390 --> 09:19.720
What matters most now is

09:20.160 --> 09:21.490
who will take the throne

09:22.150 --> 09:23.720
after His Majesty dies.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.000
After…

09:31.200 --> 09:33.390
after His Majesty dies?

09:34.240 --> 09:35.080
By right,

09:35.960 --> 09:37.090
you are the Empress,

09:37.550 --> 09:39.010
and Chengyang is your son.

09:39.030 --> 09:40.150
But His Majesty still hasn't

09:40.150 --> 09:41.550
named an heir to this day.

09:41.870 --> 09:42.670
I used to think

09:42.840 --> 09:44.460
he just couldn't decide.

09:44.870 --> 09:46.030
But he's been terminally ill

09:46.030 --> 09:46.760
for 15 years.

09:47.360 --> 09:50.420
How could he not make arrangements
for after his death?

09:50.750 --> 09:52.080
There's only one reason

09:52.440 --> 09:53.510
he kept it from you—

09:54.360 --> 09:55.790
the heir he chose

09:55.790 --> 09:56.910
isn't your son.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.360
I didn't know.

10:04.150 --> 10:06.000
He never told me anything.

10:06.150 --> 10:08.210
That's because he doesn't trust you.

10:08.320 --> 10:09.180
Remember this—

10:10.200 --> 10:11.360
I'll make sure Chengyang

10:11.360 --> 10:12.360
takes the throne.

10:13.360 --> 10:15.420
Things won't be peaceful for a while.

10:16.360 --> 10:18.820
Keep your eyes on Chengyang
and stay sharp.

10:24.480 --> 10:25.390
Now's not the time

10:25.390 --> 10:26.750
to grieve.

10:43.590 --> 10:45.510
[Rongyang Palace]

10:53.940 --> 10:57.140
[Rongyang Palace]

11:00.360 --> 11:01.050
What?

11:01.280 --> 11:03.150
Are we under house arrest here?

11:03.200 --> 11:04.180
Can't I go out for a walk?

11:04.180 --> 11:05.200
Palace grounds are off-limits.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.460
No outsiders allowed.

11:07.000 --> 11:07.860
Please go back.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.740
No outsiders allowed?

11:11.300 --> 11:12.960
Not even the Prince of Zhennan?

11:12.960 --> 11:14.020
We've been ordered

11:14.030 --> 11:15.080
to prevent anyone from trespassing

11:15.080 --> 11:15.860
on the palace grounds.

11:15.860 --> 11:18.370
[Rongyang Palace]

11:16.510 --> 11:17.790
This path marks the boundary.

11:17.790 --> 11:19.050
Please do not cross it.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.000
Got it.

11:22.250 --> 11:28.110
[Rongyang Palace]

11:31.150 --> 11:32.010
Your Highness.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.840
There are guards at the gate.

11:37.960 --> 11:40.420
They say
the palace grounds are off-limits.

11:40.660 --> 11:41.290
Looks like

11:41.600 --> 11:43.330
we're under house arrest here.

11:43.740 --> 11:45.360
They're watching us so closely.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.560
We can't do anything.

11:47.400 --> 11:48.400
I figured as much.

11:49.620 --> 11:50.950
Someone just came to say

11:51.390 --> 11:53.600
the Emperor is hosting a welcome banquet.

11:53.600 --> 11:55.560
Let's see if an opportunity comes up then.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.390
Xia Jingyan is very hostile toward you.

11:57.390 --> 11:59.030
In my view, this welcome banquet

11:59.030 --> 11:59.870
is a trap.

12:02.200 --> 12:03.600
He wouldn't dare kill me.

12:04.030 --> 12:05.480
He did everything he did

12:05.750 --> 12:07.600
in the Empress Dowager's palace today

12:07.600 --> 12:08.150
just to make

12:08.150 --> 12:09.510
the whole world know

12:09.840 --> 12:11.040
he's not afraid of me.

12:11.120 --> 12:11.840
To make it clear

12:11.840 --> 12:13.150
that my life is in his hands.

12:13.150 --> 12:14.150
I'm afraid by now,

12:14.510 --> 12:16.030
every official in court knows

12:16.030 --> 12:17.750
he threatened me with a knife.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.520
How childish.

12:22.910 --> 12:23.860
Even if he won't kill you,

12:23.860 --> 12:24.840
he'll certainly

12:24.870 --> 12:25.840
humiliate you.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.440
Now that we're in Shengjing,

12:29.630 --> 12:30.630
this kind of thing

12:31.630 --> 12:32.790
is bound to happen.

12:39.160 --> 12:41.080
Mother has let you live until now

12:41.390 --> 12:42.000
only out of respect

12:42.000 --> 12:42.910
for Father!

12:46.120 --> 12:47.150
Last night, Father

12:47.150 --> 12:48.680
passed into the afterlife.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.170
You won't live much longer either.

12:59.910 --> 13:01.030
How satisfying!

13:02.910 --> 13:04.270
Why are you just standing there?

13:04.270 --> 13:05.470
Hurry and pull him up.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.000
Take this.

13:19.670 --> 13:21.030
I've circled some names.

13:21.030 --> 13:21.890
Memorize them.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.320
You might need them one day.

13:23.250 --> 13:25.690
[Dai Jin] [Wang Encheng]

13:24.750 --> 13:25.480
Understood.

13:27.720 --> 13:28.980
Where's Her Highness?

13:29.790 --> 13:30.520
Bai Shouzhuo

13:30.720 --> 13:32.050
just sent some servants

13:32.150 --> 13:33.960
to help her settle in.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.330
She's a princess

13:37.120 --> 13:38.260
but is forced

13:38.320 --> 13:40.600
to live in a place
as rundown as Rongyang Palace.

13:40.600 --> 13:41.530
It's hard on her.

13:41.840 --> 13:42.870
It truly is.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.840
The floor needs to be cleaner.

13:47.840 --> 13:48.510
Yes.

13:51.150 --> 13:52.280
Move all these away,

13:52.360 --> 13:53.180
and this.

13:53.670 --> 13:54.530
Potted plants…

13:54.550 --> 13:55.510
Put them over there.

13:55.510 --> 13:56.240
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:56.260 --> 13:57.520
Put them on that table.

13:58.080 --> 13:58.870
The plants in the courtyard

13:58.870 --> 14:00.330
need to be tended to daily.

14:00.390 --> 14:01.200
-Yes.
-Yes.

14:03.150 --> 14:03.910
Thank you.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.500
Your Highness is back.

14:09.000 --> 14:09.510
I asked them

14:09.510 --> 14:10.670
to wash all those

14:10.670 --> 14:12.240
old curtains.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.320
The old furniture

14:13.320 --> 14:15.000
can't be replaced right away,

14:15.150 --> 14:16.880
so I had it cleaned thoroughly.

14:17.150 --> 14:18.270
With everything in order,

14:18.270 --> 14:18.840
I hope it helps

14:18.840 --> 14:20.370
lift your spirits a little.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.250
I never expected

14:22.360 --> 14:24.380
Your Highness would adapt so quickly.

14:24.380 --> 14:26.150
You thought I was spoiled

14:26.240 --> 14:27.030
and would complain

14:27.030 --> 14:28.200
when I saw how old and shabby

14:28.200 --> 14:29.530
the Rongyang Palace is?

14:34.270 --> 14:36.070
Your Highness thought the same?

14:40.390 --> 14:41.850
As long as I'm by your side,

14:43.030 --> 14:44.480
no hardship scares me.

14:51.540 --> 14:53.670
Do you have any wishes?

14:54.220 --> 14:56.080
If it's something I can help with,

14:56.120 --> 14:58.000
I'll fulfill it for you.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.570
Military Advisor Xiao,

15:01.840 --> 15:03.480
would you give us a moment?

15:06.750 --> 15:08.280
Everyone, come out with me.

15:09.910 --> 15:10.840
-Yes.
-Yes.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.600
You just said you'd fulfill
my wishes for me.

15:20.600 --> 15:21.730
What does that mean?

15:23.550 --> 15:25.280
You're clever, Your Highness.

15:25.510 --> 15:27.040
I believe you already know.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.750
I helped you escape Yujing.

15:30.870 --> 15:32.790
You don't want to be indebted to me,

15:32.790 --> 15:33.510
so you want to help me

15:33.510 --> 15:34.740
fulfill a wish.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.330
If one isn't enough,

15:36.600 --> 15:37.200
you can have three.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.260
Just one is enough.

15:40.790 --> 15:41.480
My wish is

15:41.480 --> 15:43.270
for us to be deeply in love

15:44.270 --> 15:45.800
and stay together forever.

15:56.080 --> 15:56.690
I'm sorry,

15:57.440 --> 15:58.570
but I cannot do that.

16:00.800 --> 16:02.770
♪ Flying alone ♪

16:03.170 --> 16:05.770
♪ With no need for direction ♪

16:08.370 --> 16:10.590
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

16:10.000 --> 16:10.960
In that case,

16:10.870 --> 16:13.570
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

16:12.510 --> 16:14.120
you'll just owe me a favor.

16:15.390 --> 16:16.790
I'll tell you when I think of something.

16:16.210 --> 16:17.820
♪ Roaming freely ♪

16:18.200 --> 16:21.510
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

16:25.160 --> 16:28.440
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:31.150 --> 16:35.050
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

16:39.910 --> 16:43.280
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:57.790 --> 16:58.550
Brother,

16:59.390 --> 17:00.450
I've learned about

17:01.320 --> 17:02.380
Father's illness.

17:05.240 --> 17:07.300
Even Lord Ling, with all his skills,

17:07.920 --> 17:09.349
can't do anything?

17:13.349 --> 17:13.880
Will Father

17:13.880 --> 17:15.160
never wake up again?

17:15.839 --> 17:16.569
Don't worry.

17:17.240 --> 17:19.240
His Majesty will certainly wake up.

17:21.240 --> 17:21.920
Really?

17:24.310 --> 17:24.829
Suige,

17:25.510 --> 17:27.040
when Father wakes up,

17:27.069 --> 17:28.490
we should persuade him

17:28.550 --> 17:29.320
not to

17:29.350 --> 17:30.550
work so hard anymore.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.350
I know,

17:36.960 --> 17:38.560
you don't say it out loud,

17:38.790 --> 17:39.590
but deep down,

17:40.430 --> 17:41.740
you care about Father.

17:42.920 --> 17:43.880
Then why is it

17:44.030 --> 17:45.880
that every time you two meet,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.790
you end up arguing?

17:49.510 --> 17:51.710
There are things you don't understand.

17:51.790 --> 17:52.510
And I hope

17:52.530 --> 17:53.560
you never will.

17:55.200 --> 17:56.660
Maybe I don't understand,

17:57.030 --> 17:57.640
but I just

17:58.350 --> 18:00.110
wish you and Father

18:00.110 --> 18:01.240
could get along.

18:02.110 --> 18:02.880
Now that Xiyang

18:02.880 --> 18:04.070
has left Susha,

18:04.400 --> 18:05.310
Father only has

18:06.240 --> 18:07.570
the two of us by his side.

18:13.750 --> 18:14.720
You've grown up.

18:15.680 --> 18:17.010
Much more sensible now.

18:37.880 --> 18:38.550
Uncle!

18:39.310 --> 18:39.960
Uncle!

18:41.640 --> 18:42.160
Uncle.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.110
Uncle.

18:43.590 --> 18:44.350
I'm back.

18:53.920 --> 18:55.230
Forgive me, Uncle.

18:55.310 --> 18:57.710
No loud voices inside the ancestral hall.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.190
Uncle,

19:09.640 --> 19:11.000
as soon as I received your message,

19:11.000 --> 19:12.730
I rushed back as fast as I could.

19:12.830 --> 19:13.480
Just now,

19:13.920 --> 19:15.270
I was so happy to see you

19:15.310 --> 19:16.840
and forgot myself a little.

19:17.270 --> 19:18.550
Please forgive me.

19:27.350 --> 19:28.410
Are you very happy?

19:31.750 --> 19:33.260
In your letter, you said

19:33.480 --> 19:34.920
that old man Feng Pingcheng

19:34.920 --> 19:35.750
is terminally ill.

19:35.750 --> 19:37.050
Of course I'm happy!

19:38.590 --> 19:40.000
Heaven is smiling on us.

19:40.000 --> 19:40.480
No.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.510
It's Brother Jingheng
blessing you from above.

19:42.510 --> 19:44.110
He's helping you from above!

19:48.030 --> 19:49.030
Stupid pig!

19:49.050 --> 19:50.070
Stupid pig!

19:50.090 --> 19:50.790
Stupid!

19:51.070 --> 19:51.750
-Stupid!
-Uncle.

19:51.750 --> 19:52.210
Stupid!

19:52.240 --> 19:52.920
Uncle, sorry.

19:52.920 --> 19:53.380
Stupid!

19:53.480 --> 19:54.160
Forgive me.

19:54.240 --> 19:54.960
Stupid!

19:56.030 --> 19:56.720
Uncle,

19:58.310 --> 19:59.440
at least tell me

19:59.510 --> 20:00.690
what I did wrong.

20:01.110 --> 20:02.000
Listen,

20:02.400 --> 20:03.860
Feng Pingcheng has to die,

20:03.920 --> 20:05.500
but he must die by my hand!

20:05.590 --> 20:07.670
I can't wait to tear him to pieces!

20:07.960 --> 20:08.790
I will not allow him

20:08.790 --> 20:09.550
to die of illness!

20:09.550 --> 20:10.510
I won't allow it!

20:12.110 --> 20:14.510
All these years
of grieving my son's death—

20:14.640 --> 20:15.480
I have sworn

20:15.920 --> 20:16.920
to make him pay a hundredfold,

20:16.920 --> 20:17.990
a thousandfold!

20:19.110 --> 20:19.900
I want him

20:20.310 --> 20:21.730
to watch Feng Suige

20:21.790 --> 20:23.520
die miserably before his eyes.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.730
I want him to kneel at my feet

20:25.880 --> 20:28.010
begging me to spare Feng Suige's life!

20:29.140 --> 20:30.210
All these years,

20:31.750 --> 20:33.240
I've been imagining the day

20:33.240 --> 20:34.350
when Feng Pingcheng, old and grey,

20:34.350 --> 20:35.640
buries his young son.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.560
I want...

20:37.880 --> 20:38.880
I want to see him living

20:38.880 --> 20:40.000
in hell with my own eyes.

20:40.000 --> 20:42.000
How could I let him die from illness?

20:44.000 --> 20:45.060
I summoned you back

20:45.480 --> 20:47.080
because I have a task for you.

20:52.510 --> 20:54.110
I await your command, Uncle.

20:54.160 --> 20:56.270
He's been unconscious for five days.

20:56.270 --> 20:58.130
I can't let him die just like this.

20:59.830 --> 21:01.570
You must find a way at any cost

21:02.590 --> 21:04.360
to wake him up.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.970
Even if it means poison,

21:06.000 --> 21:07.130
you must wake him up!

21:07.590 --> 21:08.070
I want him

21:08.070 --> 21:09.270
to be fully conscious

21:09.310 --> 21:11.070
when he sees Feng Suige

21:11.160 --> 21:12.830
suffer and die!

21:14.000 --> 21:15.000
Understood.

21:27.000 --> 21:29.620
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Aunt Wang]

21:29.670 --> 21:32.590
[Ancestral Virtue and Familial Merit]

21:59.350 --> 21:59.920
Father.

22:06.790 --> 22:07.870
Why are you back?

22:08.000 --> 22:09.600
Your birthday is in two days.

22:09.920 --> 22:10.750
Of course I had to come back

22:10.750 --> 22:11.810
to celebrate it with you.

22:11.810 --> 22:12.680
I came back secretly

22:12.680 --> 22:14.360
just to surprise you.

22:16.000 --> 22:17.440
You're busy
with military affairs out there,

22:17.440 --> 22:18.590
serving the country.

22:18.590 --> 22:20.450
That already makes me very proud.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.270
You didn't need to go through

22:22.270 --> 22:23.930
all this trouble to come back.

22:24.790 --> 22:26.110
I'm old now

22:26.880 --> 22:29.140
and don't care about birthdays anymore.

22:29.200 --> 22:30.540
You're not old at all.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.070
You're still strong and vigorous.

22:32.070 --> 22:33.110
Your best days are

22:33.200 --> 22:34.060
yet to come.

22:35.110 --> 22:35.710
By the way,

22:36.110 --> 22:37.480
I've prepared a special gift

22:37.480 --> 22:38.880
for your birthday

22:38.920 --> 22:39.800
this time.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.290
You coming home

22:41.290 --> 22:42.620
already makes me happy.

22:42.750 --> 22:43.720
No need to fuss

22:43.750 --> 22:45.320
over gifts.

22:45.680 --> 22:46.920
A gift is necessary.

22:47.110 --> 22:48.040
It's a surprise.

22:48.110 --> 22:49.240
I won't tell you yet.

22:50.160 --> 22:50.750
I'll go check

22:50.750 --> 22:52.550
how the preparations are going.

23:03.200 --> 23:04.000
Prime Minister,

23:04.000 --> 23:05.660
Elder Marquis Murong is here.

23:11.700 --> 23:12.720
So secretive.

23:12.830 --> 23:13.750
If there's something,

23:13.750 --> 23:15.410
you can just send me a message.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.790
Why force an old cripple like me

23:17.790 --> 23:19.160
to come here in person?

23:19.640 --> 23:21.070
If it weren't something huge,

23:21.070 --> 23:22.200
I wouldn't have

23:22.200 --> 23:23.310
disturbed you.

23:23.720 --> 23:25.400
His Majesty is terminally ill.

23:25.400 --> 23:26.600
Are you aware of this?

23:28.320 --> 23:29.250
What did you say?

23:31.920 --> 23:33.350
So even you didn't know.

23:34.200 --> 23:36.330
His Majesty kept everyone in the dark.

23:37.070 --> 23:37.980
I wonder

23:38.510 --> 23:39.840
who he actually trusts.

23:40.720 --> 23:41.650
Terminally ill?

23:42.590 --> 23:44.550
His Majesty has been
unconscious for so long

23:44.550 --> 23:45.680
because he's...

23:45.720 --> 23:47.210
I just found out today,

23:47.480 --> 23:48.640
so I invited you over immediately

23:48.640 --> 23:50.110
to discuss it.

23:51.830 --> 23:53.310
You called me here tonight

23:54.000 --> 23:55.140
surely not just

23:55.200 --> 23:56.060
to tell me about

23:56.070 --> 23:57.930
His Majesty's condition, right?

23:58.920 --> 24:00.980
Back then, we fought for this kingdom

24:01.310 --> 24:02.710
with all our old friends.

24:02.830 --> 24:04.160
We weathered the storms

24:04.440 --> 24:06.170
and rode across battlefields.

24:07.160 --> 24:08.510
Now, among those still alive,

24:08.510 --> 24:09.840
aside from His Majesty,

24:10.850 --> 24:12.650
there are only the two of us left.

24:13.030 --> 24:13.820
Some things

24:14.070 --> 24:15.880
can't be left unspoken forever.

24:17.640 --> 24:19.000
I've heard

24:19.750 --> 24:22.110
that while His Majesty lay ill,

24:22.440 --> 24:23.970
you filled all the key posts

24:24.000 --> 24:25.160
with people

24:25.160 --> 24:26.490
from the Zhuang family.

24:26.790 --> 24:28.510
You know the proposed candidate

24:28.510 --> 24:30.640
for Minister of War—

24:31.720 --> 24:33.380
Liu Qin, Vice Minister of War.

24:33.710 --> 24:34.720
He's not a Zhuang.

24:35.400 --> 24:36.200
But in the end,

24:36.830 --> 24:37.960
he's still your man.

24:38.350 --> 24:39.200
Are you saying

24:39.920 --> 24:41.060
you haven't placed

24:41.440 --> 24:43.270
your own people in the court?

24:43.960 --> 24:45.480
Li Liang at the Court of Judicial Review,

24:45.480 --> 24:46.990
Liu Jin at the Censorate—

24:47.440 --> 24:49.070
aren't they your longtime associates?

24:49.070 --> 24:50.120
And your nephew,

24:50.550 --> 24:51.640
Murong Jie,

24:52.000 --> 24:54.000
holds a key post in the Jinwu Guards.

24:54.270 --> 24:56.670
You've placed quite a few people yourself.

25:01.160 --> 25:01.890
Zhuang Shen,

25:02.830 --> 25:04.440
you called me here today

25:04.960 --> 25:06.030
for the matter

25:06.030 --> 25:07.430
of naming an heir, right?

25:08.110 --> 25:08.800
Yes.

25:09.640 --> 25:11.440
I just want to hear your opinion.

25:13.160 --> 25:14.360
To hear my opinion?

25:16.160 --> 25:18.030
My opinion doesn't matter at all!

25:18.680 --> 25:20.340
Stop beating around the bush.

25:21.880 --> 25:22.680
Even if

25:23.840 --> 25:25.850
His Majesty and the First Prince

25:26.200 --> 25:27.200
fall out

25:27.240 --> 25:28.350
completely,

25:29.200 --> 25:30.980
I'll still advise this:

25:31.200 --> 25:32.200
the heir should be

25:32.400 --> 25:33.930
the eldest legitimate son!

25:35.480 --> 25:36.270
So,

25:37.110 --> 25:39.550
your preferred heir is

25:39.790 --> 25:41.350
the First Prince?

25:43.510 --> 25:45.580
He fought on battlefields for years,

25:45.790 --> 25:47.720
winning one battle after another.

25:47.880 --> 25:49.650
The people of Susha

25:49.790 --> 25:51.250
are all well aware of this.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.550
Who can inherit the throne

25:52.550 --> 25:54.200
depends not on military achievements

25:54.200 --> 25:55.190
but on virtue.

25:55.310 --> 25:56.030
Enough!

25:56.750 --> 25:58.400
You just want your grandson

25:58.440 --> 25:59.960
Feng Chengyang on the throne.

25:59.960 --> 26:00.590
Listen,

26:01.240 --> 26:03.240
unless you can control the whole court,

26:03.240 --> 26:03.920
as long as

26:04.240 --> 26:05.400
I still draw breath,

26:05.480 --> 26:06.550
I'll never agree!

26:11.150 --> 26:18.830
[Zhuang Residence]

26:15.440 --> 26:16.240
Give me a hand.

26:21.040 --> 26:23.250
[Zhuang Residence]

26:37.160 --> 26:37.960
This is the medicine

26:37.960 --> 26:39.510
your father needs to take tonight.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.270
I suggest

26:40.880 --> 26:43.210
you have an imperial physician examine it

26:43.270 --> 26:44.920
so no one will gossip

26:45.030 --> 26:47.160
and accuse me of harming your emperor.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.550
You persuaded Lord Ling

26:49.550 --> 26:50.720
to come back during the day.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.590
Although he's agreed

26:51.590 --> 26:52.960
to continue treating His Majesty,

26:52.960 --> 26:54.790
he's still angry.

26:55.960 --> 26:56.790
Who do you mean?

26:56.790 --> 26:57.510
Me?

26:57.810 --> 26:59.150
I'm still angry?

26:59.400 --> 27:00.960
You think I'd stoop to their level?

27:00.960 --> 27:01.560
Ma Qiming,

27:01.640 --> 27:03.350
I think you're the one who's angry.

27:03.350 --> 27:04.070
You resent me

27:04.070 --> 27:05.550
for revealing Feng Pingcheng's illness.

27:05.550 --> 27:06.790
I know what you're thinking!

27:06.790 --> 27:07.810
I wouldn't dare.

27:08.070 --> 27:08.680
I remember

27:08.680 --> 27:10.070
everything you've done

27:10.200 --> 27:11.200
for His Majesty

27:11.200 --> 27:12.130
all these years.

27:12.270 --> 27:13.550
I'm grateful to you

27:13.550 --> 27:15.490
for saving His Majesty's life.

27:16.070 --> 27:16.790
Eunuch Ma.

27:17.270 --> 27:17.750
Yes.

27:18.440 --> 27:20.370
From now on, if anyone in the palace

27:20.790 --> 27:22.110
dares to speak ill

27:22.160 --> 27:23.240
of Lord Ling again,

27:23.620 --> 27:25.680
just give them 30 strokes of the cane.

27:25.880 --> 27:28.010
If any trouble is caused because of it,

27:28.160 --> 27:29.690
I'll take responsibility.

27:30.030 --> 27:30.510
Yes.

27:30.640 --> 27:31.510
I understand.

27:34.070 --> 27:34.830
Lord Ling.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.350
How is he doing now?

27:39.920 --> 27:41.180
In a day or two at least,

27:42.030 --> 27:43.110
or ten days at most,

27:43.240 --> 27:44.110
he will wake up.

27:44.440 --> 27:46.100
As for how well he'll recover,

27:46.680 --> 27:48.080
that depends on his fate.

28:16.720 --> 28:17.310
Great!

28:40.840 --> 28:42.430
Isn't this my brother,

28:42.590 --> 28:43.850
the Prince of Zhennan?

28:46.350 --> 28:47.810
Greetings, Your Majesty.

28:52.030 --> 28:52.950
Yesterday,

28:53.030 --> 28:55.300
you nearly died by my blade,

28:58.240 --> 29:00.750
and today you still dare
to attend the banquet.

29:00.750 --> 29:02.460
You truly don't fear death.

29:11.790 --> 29:13.640
Your Majesty, please don't go too far.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.370
Even if the Prince of Zhennan
has displeased you,

29:15.370 --> 29:17.070
he's here at your invitation.

29:17.720 --> 29:19.070
Humiliating him like this

29:19.070 --> 29:20.480
is a step too far!

29:27.200 --> 29:27.960
Brother,

29:28.640 --> 29:31.140
your wife is defending you so fiercely.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.680
Are you moved?

29:51.070 --> 29:52.070
You may rise.

29:54.750 --> 29:56.150
Thank you, Your Majesty.

29:57.510 --> 29:58.160
Come.

29:58.270 --> 29:58.890
Brother,

29:59.200 --> 30:01.060
let me introduce you to everyone.

30:02.120 --> 30:04.380
Wang Encheng, Vice Minister of Revenue.

30:05.960 --> 30:07.680
Lu Wang, Minister of Rites.

30:09.200 --> 30:11.800
Shan Huaiqing,
Minister of Imperial Stables.

30:12.000 --> 30:14.350
They're all pillars of the court.

30:14.390 --> 30:15.110
Brother,

30:15.590 --> 30:17.390
you should get to know them well.

30:20.550 --> 30:21.160
Be seated.

30:34.200 --> 30:35.600
You may not know this yet.

30:35.920 --> 30:37.240
My brother now

30:37.440 --> 30:39.440
holds a new role in addition to being

30:39.440 --> 30:40.700
the Prince of Zhennan.

30:41.680 --> 30:44.750
He's also the live-in son-in-law of Susha.

30:51.240 --> 30:53.680
For lasting peace between our two nations,

30:53.790 --> 30:56.030
Your Majesty agreed to
the Prince of Zhennan staying in Susha.

30:56.030 --> 30:58.410
But the prince has returned on his own.

30:58.510 --> 31:00.240
Doesn't this make Your Majesty

31:00.720 --> 31:03.470
appear to go back on your word?

31:04.830 --> 31:05.750
Leaving Susha

31:05.750 --> 31:07.160
was entirely my decision.

31:07.160 --> 31:08.750
It had nothing to do with His Highness.

31:08.750 --> 31:09.830
If Your Majesty wishes

31:09.830 --> 31:11.490
to punish someone, punish me.

31:16.310 --> 31:18.200
The princess eloped with the prince.

31:18.200 --> 31:19.160
Such a bold act

31:19.160 --> 31:20.660
is truly admirable.

31:20.830 --> 31:23.160
We are deeply impressed.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.310
Enough.

31:29.830 --> 31:31.920
We'll just enjoy ourselves tonight.

31:32.000 --> 31:33.400
Stop talking about that.

31:34.030 --> 31:35.920
I'm in such a great mood today.

31:36.400 --> 31:37.000
Brother,

31:37.200 --> 31:38.610
you must

31:38.640 --> 31:40.500
have a good drink with me tonight.

31:43.350 --> 31:43.880
Go.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.550
Serve His Highness properly.

31:45.550 --> 31:46.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.160
Please.

32:09.350 --> 32:11.270
You can't even serve wine properly.

32:11.270 --> 32:12.870
Why should I keep you around?

32:14.680 --> 32:15.270
Guards!

32:17.550 --> 32:18.880
Your Majesty, spare me!

32:20.480 --> 32:22.340
Drag her out and beat her to death.

32:23.270 --> 32:24.610
Your Majesty, spare me!

32:24.830 --> 32:25.790
Your Majesty!

32:26.550 --> 32:27.830
Your Majesty!

32:28.590 --> 32:29.720
Your Majesty!

32:31.960 --> 32:32.640
See?

32:33.200 --> 32:35.130
Someone died because of you again.

32:40.960 --> 32:41.480
Go.

32:42.200 --> 32:43.730
Pour wine for His Highness.

32:44.720 --> 32:45.400
Yes.

33:06.680 --> 33:07.480
Your Majesty.

33:10.070 --> 33:10.920
Please let me

33:10.920 --> 33:12.070
serve His Highness.

34:02.510 --> 34:04.070
Lady Zhuang Jingyuan,

34:04.090 --> 34:05.400
virtuous, gentle,

34:05.440 --> 34:06.640
and graceful,

34:06.720 --> 34:08.070
has pleased me greatly.

34:08.230 --> 34:11.000
She is hereby promoted
to fourth-rank Consort Yuan.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.480
End of the decree.

34:13.000 --> 34:14.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:17.320 --> 34:19.179
Congratulations, Consort Yuan.

34:20.230 --> 34:21.590
Come to me.

34:26.150 --> 34:26.949
Your Majesty.

34:28.670 --> 34:30.110
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

34:30.110 --> 34:32.440
Her Majesty has given birth to a princess.

34:32.590 --> 34:34.449
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

34:35.110 --> 34:35.800
Wonderful.

34:36.510 --> 34:38.370
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

34:38.670 --> 34:39.670
Now, Your Majesty

34:39.670 --> 34:41.190
has both a son and a daughter.

34:41.190 --> 34:41.989
Yeah, indeed.

34:42.000 --> 34:42.800
Your Majesty.

34:43.920 --> 34:44.800
One day,

34:44.920 --> 34:45.670
I shall also bear

34:45.670 --> 34:47.270
a prince for you, if you wish.

34:47.630 --> 34:49.150
Of course.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.440
Let's go see the Empress.

35:02.760 --> 35:04.290
Greetings, Your Highness.

35:07.590 --> 35:09.650
Her Majesty hasn't eaten her dinner.

35:09.670 --> 35:10.230
She's been sitting there

35:10.230 --> 35:11.230
for several hours

35:11.480 --> 35:12.740
without saying a word.

35:18.840 --> 35:20.170
What are you doing here?

35:21.040 --> 35:21.920
It's so late.

35:22.320 --> 35:23.510
Why are you still up?

35:24.230 --> 35:25.070
Mother,

35:25.800 --> 35:27.460
please take care of yourself.

35:27.550 --> 35:28.810
Don't grieve too much.

35:41.560 --> 35:49.700
[Murong Residence]

35:46.030 --> 35:47.560
Elder Marquis, we're home.

35:49.400 --> 35:50.260
Elder Marquis?

35:53.230 --> 35:54.090
Elder Marquis.

35:56.040 --> 35:57.600
Elder Marquis is missing!

35:57.620 --> 35:59.570
What should we do now?

36:02.550 --> 36:03.580
What happened?

36:03.870 --> 36:04.800
How did my father go missing

36:04.800 --> 36:05.860
after one trip out?

36:06.280 --> 36:06.760
I…

36:06.810 --> 36:08.110
I truly know nothing.

36:08.130 --> 36:09.510
It took us over an hour to get back

36:09.510 --> 36:10.760
from Prime Minister Zhuang's mansion.

36:10.760 --> 36:12.030
I checked the carriage when we arrived,

36:12.030 --> 36:13.000
and the Elder Marquis was

36:13.000 --> 36:14.340
already gone.

36:14.550 --> 36:15.630
Think carefully.

36:15.710 --> 36:17.280
Did anything unusual happen on the way?

36:17.280 --> 36:19.210
Aside from a cow blocking the road…

36:22.230 --> 36:23.710
I got down and led it away.

36:23.810 --> 36:25.320
Nothing else happened.

36:27.510 --> 36:28.760
After moving the cow,

36:28.790 --> 36:29.710
did you check whether my father

36:29.710 --> 36:31.110
was still in the carriage?

36:31.110 --> 36:32.090
No.

36:32.670 --> 36:34.240
I didn't hear a sound,

36:34.480 --> 36:35.580
so I thought

36:35.630 --> 36:36.830
he had fallen asleep.

36:41.440 --> 36:42.760
Where did you see the cow?

36:42.760 --> 36:43.800
Past Yudai Bridge,

36:43.800 --> 36:45.330
at the third intersection.

36:45.480 --> 36:45.920
Right,

36:45.920 --> 36:47.850
there's a crooked tree by the road.

36:52.480 --> 36:53.590
Search every house

36:53.590 --> 36:54.650
in that area.

36:54.700 --> 36:55.880
Even if we have to turn the Yujing City

36:55.880 --> 36:56.360
upside down,

36:56.360 --> 36:57.290
we must find him!

36:57.440 --> 36:57.920
Yes.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.190
Fu Yixiao,

37:02.230 --> 37:03.320
I know it was you.

37:03.960 --> 37:04.960
When I catch you,

37:05.150 --> 37:06.960
I'll skin you alive

37:06.960 --> 37:08.290
and cut you into pieces!

37:17.670 --> 37:18.360
Who are you?

37:19.360 --> 37:20.230
How dare you

37:20.230 --> 37:21.190
abduct me

37:21.190 --> 37:22.990
right under the Emperor's nose?

37:23.710 --> 37:24.880
No wonder you're

37:24.920 --> 37:26.520
a battle-hardened marquis.

37:26.960 --> 37:28.520
Even in danger,

37:28.760 --> 37:29.760
you stay calm

37:30.000 --> 37:30.960
and unafraid.

37:33.110 --> 37:34.920
So you know who I am.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.440
It seems you're my enemy,

37:38.070 --> 37:39.530
but I don't recognize you.

37:40.320 --> 37:42.110
I spent decades guarding the borders,

37:42.110 --> 37:43.570
fighting countless wars.

37:43.590 --> 37:45.630
I've made more enemies than I can count.

37:45.630 --> 37:47.150
Which side are you on?

37:47.280 --> 37:49.000
What grudge do you have against me?

37:49.000 --> 37:49.920
Go on, say it.

37:50.000 --> 37:50.880
I'm all ears.

37:51.880 --> 37:54.280
Years stationed in the freezing north

37:54.550 --> 37:56.080
left your legs in bad shape.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.320
And even so,

37:57.480 --> 37:58.800
His Majesty still wouldn't
let you come home

37:58.800 --> 38:00.260
to enjoy your retirement.

38:00.480 --> 38:01.800
Is that why the Murong family

38:01.800 --> 38:03.190
hates His Majesty?

38:05.070 --> 38:05.880
That's all?

38:06.960 --> 38:09.280
I don't even know
what you're talking about.

38:09.280 --> 38:11.770
My loyalty to His Majesty

38:12.000 --> 38:13.000
is as clear as day.

38:13.670 --> 38:15.840
I have never hated His Majesty.

38:16.590 --> 38:18.190
Then why is your son, Murong Yao,

38:18.190 --> 38:19.460
plotting mutiny?

38:34.550 --> 38:36.210
It seems you don't believe me.

38:38.150 --> 38:39.900
I joined the army as a boy

38:40.000 --> 38:41.710
and spent decades on the battlefield.

38:41.710 --> 38:42.550
You have no idea

38:42.550 --> 38:43.400
how many people

38:43.400 --> 38:45.960
have tried to frame me for treason

38:46.000 --> 38:47.150
before His Majesty.

38:47.510 --> 38:49.170
If you're going to slander me,

38:49.590 --> 38:51.590
at least come up with something new.

38:52.840 --> 38:54.510
Yao is plotting mutiny?

38:55.510 --> 38:57.420
Sure, he's always been a handful,

38:57.480 --> 38:58.800
but I've never thought of him

38:58.800 --> 39:00.140
as ambitious.

39:00.670 --> 39:02.710
I actually wish he were different

39:02.730 --> 39:03.670
so he wouldn't

39:03.670 --> 39:05.280
spend every day in debauchery

39:05.280 --> 39:06.340
and waste his life.

39:06.440 --> 39:09.280
You think I haven't tried to pull strings

39:09.400 --> 39:11.480
for him in the army and the court?

39:11.780 --> 39:13.040
He just refused.

39:13.280 --> 39:15.070
He won't even take an official post,

39:15.070 --> 39:17.150
but you're saying he's plotting mutiny?

39:17.150 --> 39:18.190
This is the biggest joke

39:18.190 --> 39:19.480
I've heard all year!

39:20.280 --> 39:22.070
Murong Yao conspired with Jinxiu

39:22.070 --> 39:23.710
to assassinate the First Prince.

39:23.710 --> 39:24.640
Do you know what?

39:28.070 --> 39:29.510
Now I know who you are.

39:30.550 --> 39:32.280
You're that female general from Jinxiu—

39:32.280 --> 39:33.550
one of Suige's people.

39:34.710 --> 39:36.570
A Jinxiu general is accusing Yao

39:36.590 --> 39:39.190
of colluding with Jinxiu?

39:39.880 --> 39:41.230
A dissolute playboy

39:41.360 --> 39:43.030
from a noble family

39:43.280 --> 39:44.110
who goes around

39:44.110 --> 39:45.670
with four pretty assassins—

39:45.670 --> 39:47.000
who does he want to kill?

39:47.760 --> 39:48.960
Do you really know

39:49.240 --> 39:50.350
your own son?

39:50.920 --> 39:52.070
Do you know

39:52.070 --> 39:53.280
who he associates with

39:53.280 --> 39:54.360
and who he keeps around him?

39:54.360 --> 39:55.590
You were always away at the border.

39:55.590 --> 39:56.960
Do you really know what he's been doing

39:56.960 --> 39:58.000
here in Yujing?

39:59.320 --> 40:01.440
You call yourself
the most loyal official in the court,

40:01.440 --> 40:02.320
but are you sure your son is

40:02.320 --> 40:03.180
as loyal as you?

40:03.510 --> 40:04.360
If he really was

40:04.360 --> 40:05.070
some playboy

40:05.070 --> 40:06.670
without ambitions like you said,

40:06.670 --> 40:07.550
why did he take the job

40:07.550 --> 40:09.010
with the Imperial Guards?

40:10.590 --> 40:12.790
That was arranged by His Majesty.

40:12.860 --> 40:14.170
You just said yourself

40:14.590 --> 40:15.630
that all his life,

40:15.800 --> 40:17.400
he's never followed orders.

40:18.670 --> 40:19.320
He…

40:22.440 --> 40:23.320
My son…

40:25.510 --> 40:26.910
I just feel sorry for you.

40:27.070 --> 40:27.960
Back then, you fought

40:27.960 --> 40:28.940
alongside His Majesty

40:28.940 --> 40:30.200
and ended up with all these injuries.

40:30.200 --> 40:31.360
His Majesty knows this full well,

40:31.360 --> 40:32.550
so why did he still send you to that cold,

40:32.550 --> 40:34.280
barren place in the northwest?

40:37.150 --> 40:38.150
Murong Yao and Feng Suige

40:38.150 --> 40:39.680
are the closest of friends.

40:39.880 --> 40:41.080
But he threatened me,

40:41.290 --> 40:42.320
saying to my face

40:42.630 --> 40:43.510
that if I ever told Feng Suige

40:43.510 --> 40:44.360
his secret,

40:44.800 --> 40:45.690
he'd find a way

40:45.840 --> 40:46.630
to kill Feng Pingcheng,

40:46.630 --> 40:48.630
who's lying in bed in the palace now.

40:49.510 --> 40:51.400
I don't care
if Feng Pingcheng lives or dies.

40:51.400 --> 40:53.180
But I won't allow anyone

40:53.230 --> 40:54.290
to hurt Feng Suige.

40:55.840 --> 40:56.630
Impossible!

40:58.030 --> 41:00.290
Yao would never say something like that.

41:00.510 --> 41:01.960
He and Suige

41:01.960 --> 41:03.910
grew up together like brothers!

41:04.150 --> 41:06.030
He would never commit treason!

41:06.880 --> 41:08.230
No matter what method Murong Yao has

41:08.230 --> 41:09.590
to threaten Feng Pingcheng,

41:09.590 --> 41:11.150
as long as I have control over you,

41:11.150 --> 41:12.030
I'm confident

41:12.280 --> 41:13.680
he won't dare make a move.

41:14.440 --> 41:15.300
Elder Marquis,

41:16.670 --> 41:17.400
I apologize.

41:27.760 --> 41:29.090
Are you feeling unwell?

41:30.760 --> 41:31.760
-Are you alright?
-Your Highness.

41:31.760 --> 41:33.160
Why did you drink so much?

41:33.360 --> 41:35.670
Could you please go get a towel,
Your Highness?

41:35.670 --> 41:36.600
Wait for me here.

41:46.190 --> 41:47.150
Did you see Wang Encheng

41:47.150 --> 41:47.880
just now?

41:48.710 --> 41:49.320
Yes.

41:50.000 --> 41:51.190
You marked his name

41:51.190 --> 41:52.520
in the Daily Chronicle.

41:52.630 --> 41:54.030
And he looks the part too.

41:54.630 --> 41:57.070
I've long heard about
Xia Jingyan's peculiarities.

41:57.070 --> 41:57.960
I just never thought

41:57.960 --> 41:59.550
that what the Daily Chronicle mentioned

41:59.550 --> 42:01.110
about his affairs with officials' wives

42:01.110 --> 42:02.170
was actually true.

42:02.280 --> 42:03.280
That Wang Encheng—

42:03.280 --> 42:04.190
see if you can find a way

42:04.190 --> 42:05.250
to get close to him.

42:05.760 --> 42:06.230
Yes.

42:07.110 --> 42:07.710
By the way,

42:08.000 --> 42:09.110
when we went in just now,

42:09.110 --> 42:10.640
was anyone standing guard?

42:11.000 --> 42:12.860
Just two eunuchs stayed in there.

42:13.070 --> 42:14.230
Looks like Xia Jingyan

42:14.230 --> 42:16.160
truly believes you've submitted.

42:16.880 --> 42:18.340
You don't understand him.

42:19.360 --> 42:21.150
Removing the guards
was just his way to test me.
